# Weakens R's StraddlerBelowInit in this module's environment from the
# initialisation's side: the re-created incarnation's first initialisation records
# no heads, so a straddler allocated before it is not below them. The re-created
# incarnation's live advance passes the straddler.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestAssumeInitHeadsMissing
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the first initialisation after a purge records no heads
PERTURBS: MarkInit
BOUNDS: WithRecreate = TRUE

--- FIND
    /\ mInit' = TRUE
    /\ hoClosedAt' = next
--- REPLACE
    /\ mInit' = TRUE
\* MUTATION: no heads are recorded.
    /\ hoClosedAt' = hoClosedAt
--- END
